{
  "language": "te",
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.78,
      "text": "Due to poor communication skills,"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 4.58,
      "end": 8.04,
      "text": "how difficult life becomes,"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 8.36,
      "end": 10.36,
      "text": "I will share a case with you."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 10.44,
      "end": 14.88,
      "text": "I am Dr. Hema Prasad, Psychologist."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 14.9,
      "end": 18.66,
      "text": "In the cases I dealt with recently,"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 18.78,
      "end": 20.36,
      "text": "a boy had communication..."
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 20.44,
      "end": 22.38,
      "text": "He studies very well,"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 22.42,
      "end": 23.94,
      "text": "gets good marks,"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 23.98,
      "end": 25.14,
      "text": "everything is very good."
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 25.2,
      "end": 28.52,
      "text": "On paper, he is very good, excellent."
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 28.66,
      "end": 30.82,
      "text": "But when made to sit and speak,"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 30.86,
      "end": 32.14,
      "text": "he fears English."
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 32.22,
      "end": 35.18,
      "text": "He fears talking to the person opposite."
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 35.26,
      "end": 37.58,
      "text": "To go and take coaching anywhere,"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 37.62,
      "end": 39.46,
      "text": "he is afraid to go to coaching."
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 39.78,
      "end": 42.66,
      "text": "With so many fears,"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 42.74,
      "end": 44.48,
      "text": "he couldn't face interviews."
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 44.52,
      "end": 46.54,
      "text": "Going to interviews, failing."
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 46.56,
      "end": 48.64,
      "text": "Going to interviews, failing."
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 48.68,
      "end": 50.48,
      "text": "Why is all this happening?"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 50.5,
      "end": 52.36,
      "text": "Mainly, nowadays,"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 52.4,
      "end": 55.44,
      "text": "there is no need to fear English."
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "start": 55.48,
      "end": 58.74,
      "text": "Because every subject you study is in English."
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "start": 58.78,
      "end": 60.78,
      "text": "Even so, why does that boy fear?"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "start": 60.9,
      "end": 64.9,
      "text": "Because he looks at an interview under a magnifying glass."
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "start": 64.94,
      "end": 68.64,
      "text": "From childhood, to speak to anyone..."
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "start": 68.74,
      "end": 71.86,
      "text": "Why does this happen? The subject with you"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "start": 71.9,
      "end": 74.88,
      "text": "is theoretical."
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "start": 74.96,
      "end": 77.2,
      "text": "You don't know the way to explain it."
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "start": 77.3,
      "end": 80.8,
      "text": "Meaning, the subject is inside you,"
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "start": 80.86,
      "end": 83.9,
      "text": "you can tell it, but cannot express it."
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "start": 83.94,
      "end": 86.66,
      "text": "Because he couldn't express it like that,"
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "start": 86.7,
      "end": 88.66,
      "text": "even though he has all the answers,"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 88.7,
      "end": 92.4,
      "text": "sadly, he is failing many interviews."
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "start": 92.44,
      "end": 94.66,
      "text": "I will tell you how to practice for this."
    }
  ]
}